    <entry xml:lang="en">
        <title>Condi Alacrigade [aDPS]</title>
        <published>2026-07-31T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2026-07-31T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>
            
              Unknown
            
          </name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://aw2.help/builds/alac-condi-renegade/"/>
        <id>https://aw2.help/builds/alac-condi-renegade/</id>
        
        <content type="html" xml:base="https://aw2.help/builds/alac-condi-renegade/">&lt;p&gt;This is the condition variant of an old but popular build without weapon swaps. The ranged nature of the build allows higher damage uptime
and a full set of Ritualist&#x27;s gear improves survivability. This build lacks self-boons for solo play.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Although the rotation is easy to learn, energy management requires active participation and requires players to to swap legends during a narrow window.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;gearing-and-consumables&quot;&gt;Gearing and Consumables&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Equipment&lt;&#x2F;th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Stats&lt;&#x2F;th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Rune&#x2F;Sigil&#x2F;Relic&lt;&#x2F;th&gt;&lt;&#x2F;tr&gt;&lt;&#x2F;thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Armor&lt;&#x2F;td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Ritualist&#x27;s&lt;&#x2F;td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;items&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;67339&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Superior Rune of the Trapper&lt;&#x2F;td&gt;&lt;&#x2F;tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Short Bow&lt;&#x2F;td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Ritualist&#x27;s&lt;&#x2F;td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;items&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;44950&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Superior Sigil of Malice&lt;&#x2F;td&gt;&lt;&#x2F;tr&gt;
