&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;41820&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Scorchrazor (Short Bow 5)&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;27917&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Call to Anguish is available in Mallyx&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;41220&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Darkrazor&#x27;s Daring is available in Kalla&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;72954&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Abyssal Blot (Spear 4 w.swap)&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;28409&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Temporal Rift (Axe 5 w.swap)&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You may bring a staff if you really need a strong CC&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ol&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;others&quot;&gt;Others&lt;&#x2F;h4&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
