&lt;li&gt;Use &lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;76503&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Unyielding Impact (flip skill) after CC for damage and energy burn&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ol&gt;
